      "两个JSON各上限`64 KiB`",
      "同一`care_basis+finding_set+requirement`下`case_generation`从1连续递增，`trigger_digest`冻结实际Health Assessment Work与其Basis，同一trigger重放必须返回同一Case且不得重复产生Work或物理效果",
      "相同`care_basis+finding_set+requirement`至多一个non-terminal Case",
      "同一`shelf_entry_id`至多一个`terminal_at_ms IS NULL`的active Case。active时三个terminal列全NULL",
