    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`aftercare_case_id PK, shelf_entry_id FK, finding_set_digest, care_basis_schema_ref, care_basis_json, care_basis_digest, care_requirement_schema_ref, care_requirement_json, care_requirement_digest, case_generation INTEGER, trigger_digest, state, terminal_reason_code NULL, terminal_evidence_digest NULL, created_at_ms, terminal_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "两个JSON各上限`64 KiB`；同一`care_basis+finding_set+requirement`下`case_generation`从1连续递增，`trigger_digest`冻结实际Health Assessment Work与其Basis，同一trigger重放必须返回同一Case且不得重复产生Work或物理效果；相同`care_basis+finding_set+requirement`至多一个non-terminal Case；同一`shelf_entry_id`至多一个`terminal_at_ms IS NULL`的active Case。active时三个terminal列全NULL；`resolved|invalidated|unresolved`时三个terminal列全非NULL并write-once，必须保存精确reason和Evidence。terminal Case不会因相同trigger静默重开；新的Assessment trigger或显式用户Retry才可在相同Basis建立下一generation。Supporting Work通过Foundation反向关联；`UNIQUE(shelf_entry_id,care_basis_digest,finding_set_digest,care_requirement_digest,case_generation)`；`UNIQUE(shelf_entry_id,trigger_digest)`；`INDEX(state,created_at_ms)`"
